sequenceDiagram
  participant F as Frontend
  participant A as API
  participant S as Storage
  participant Q as Queue
  participant W as Worker
  F->>A: create upload
  A-->>F: signed PUT
  F->>S: PDF bytes
  F->>A: complete + SHA-256
  A->>S: verify object
  A->>Q: parse job via outbox
  A-->>F: document queued
  F->>F: immediate Reader
  Q->>W: parse
  W->>S: object graph
  W->>A: pages/blocks ready
